      "side": 1,
      "message": "This doesn\u0027t change the behaviour. When `Create` is called, it allocates the min heap, and mDescriptorCount is set to that value. Before my change, there was a coupling with initializing `mDescriptorCount` in the ctor to the min value, and `Create` making sure to allocate the min heap, which was ugly. We don\u0027t need this since we specify the min descriptors we want when allocating.",
      "parentUuid": "db9e2e66_367813c5",
